a day should be okay.

365
00:21:24,770 --> 00:21:27,990
Alcohol and smoking
cessation is definitely

366
00:21:27,990 --> 00:21:31,510
beneficial for patients.
A cardiac rehab program

367
00:21:31,510 --> 00:21:34,330
can be useful to improve
functional capacity,

368
00:21:34,490 --> 00:21:38,190
exercise tolerance,
and quality of life.

369
00:21:38,970 --> 00:21:41,990
Use of cardiac devices
for selected patients

370
00:21:41,990 --> 00:21:44,810
is beneficial as
well, and we will

371
00:21:44,810 --> 00:21:47,550
