little bit more detail.

372
00:21:48,110 --> 00:21:50,790
Palliative care is particularly
important in patients

373
00:21:50,790 --> 00:21:53,330
with advanced heart failure
to support discussion

374
00:21:53,330 --> 00:21:56,770
of treatment goals, shared
decision-making regarding

375
00:21:56,770 --> 00:22:00,950
