hospitalization for worsening

379
00:22:12,750 --> 00:22:14,570
heart failure, and
decrease the risk of

380
00:22:14,570 --> 00:22:17,990
mortality and morbidity,
possibly reverse the process

381
00:22:17,990 --> 00:22:20,730
of adverse remodeling
of the left ventricle.

382
00:22:21,370 --> 00:22:24,010
Guideline-directed
medical therapy now

383
00:22:24,010 --> 00:22:26,690
includes four pillars,
as you see here,

384
00:22:26,790 --> 00:22:29,430
or quadruple therapy
that includes

385
00:22:29,430 --> 00:22:32,670
