nephrolysin inhibitor,

386
00:22:32,870 --> 00:22:35,830
beta blocker,
mineralocorticoid receptor

387
00:22:35,830 --> 00:22:39,070
antagonist, and
SGLT2 inhibitor.

388
00:22:42,830 --> 00:22:46,250
No standard medical
treatment regimen exists for

389
00:22:46,250 --> 00:22:49,770
heart failure with preserved
ejection fraction. and

390
00:22:49,770 --> 00:22:53,750
treatment is typically
focused on use of diuretics to

391
00:22:53,750 --> 00:22:56,910
relieve congestion and
management of comorbidities

392
00:22:56,910 --> 00:23:00,610
and presence of underlying
cardiovascular disease.

393
00:23:00,850 --> 00:23:04,890
There is new evidence,
however, that SGLT2 inhibitors

394
00:23:04,890 --> 00:23:07,470
can be beneficial in
decreasing heart failure

395
00:23:07,470 --> 00:23:11,110
hospitalizations and cardiovascular
mortality in this group.

396
00:23:11,910 --> 00:23:14,630
Aldosterone antagonists
may be considered

397
00:23:14,630 --> 00:23:17,390
to decrease hospitalizations
as well as RNA.

398
00:23:18,130 --> 00:23:21,750
Recent evidence suggests
that GLP-1 agonists are

399
00:23:21,750 --> 00:23:23,830
beneficial for heart
failure with preserved

400
00:23:23,830 --> 00:23:27,270
ejection fraction patients
if they also have obesity.

401
00:23:27,270 --> 00:23:30,590
This has not been
proven in patients with

402
00:23:30,590 --> 00:23:33,510
heart failure with reduced
ejection fraction yet.

403
