429
00:25:05,370 --> 00:25:07,290
Let's talk about salt and heart

430
00:25:07,290 --> 00:25:09,290
failure, or sodium
to be precise.

431
00:25:10,030 --> 00:25:12,070
Generations of physicians
have been taught

432
00:25:12,070 --> 00:25:14,910
